<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπλήρ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>filling up, means of filling up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐνδείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1118b18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ λείποντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					250.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κενουμένων τάξεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.382
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>satisfying,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐπιθυμίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1267b4
				</span></i>
			; <i>satisfaction</i> of the wants and appetites, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1173b8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>restoration,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς κατὰ τὴν φύσιν αὐταρκείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1257a30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>fulfilment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ῥήματος τοῦ Κυρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>1 Es.</u>
					1.54
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from 
				Pass.
			) <i>becoming full, overflowing,</i> of the Nile, Thales ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				<u>Epit.</u>
			</span></i>ad fin. lib. ii (vol. i <i><span class="en">
				p.278
			</span></i> Schw.).</div>
